XSS Payload Lab — local library of 100 contextual examples.
No network requests, no automatic injection, no filter evasion.
Usage:
  bash src/functions/xss402.sh --list-categories
  bash src/functions/xss402.sh --category html
  bash src/functions/xss402.sh --search attribute --format json
  bash src/functions/xss402.sh --format lines --output xss-lab.txt
Examples are executable only when you explicitly place them in your OWN lab.
Do not use on third-party services without written authorization.
